    <item>
      description : "1.145 RHEL-10-400290"
      info        : "RHEL 10 must be configured so that all local files and directories must have a valid owner.

GROUP ID: V-281075RULE ID: SV-281075r1165580

Unowned files and directories may be unintentionally inherited if a user is assigned the same user identifier (UID) as the UID of the unowned files."
