    <custom_item>
      type        : FILE_CHECK
      description : "1.155 RHEL-10-400340"
      info        : "RHEL 10 must enforce mode \"0600\" or less permissive for Secure Shell (SSH) private host key files.

GROUP ID: V-281085
RULE ID: SV-281085r1195409

If an unauthorized user obtains the private SSH host key file, the host could be impersonated."
      solution    : "Configure RHEL 10 to enforce mode \"0600\" for SSH private host key files with the following command:

$ sudo chmod 0600 /etc/ssh/ssh_host*key

Restart the SSH daemon for the changes to take effect:

$ sudo systemctl restart sshd.service"
