    <custom_item>
      type        : FILE_CONTENT_CHECK
      description : "1.178 RHEL-10-500110"
      info        : "RHEL 10 must take action when allocated audit record storage volume reaches 95 percent of the repository maximum audit record storage capacity.

GROUP ID: V-281108RULE ID: SV-281108r1166276

If action is not taken when storage volume reaches 95 percent utilization, the auditing system may fail when the storage volume reaches capacity."
      solution    : "Configure RHEL 10 auditd service to take action if allocated audit record storage volume reaching 95 percent of the repository maximum audit record storage capacity.

