      info        : "RHEL 10 must assign a home directory for local interactive user accounts upon creation.

GROUP ID: V-281171RULE ID: SV-281171r1166465

If local interactive users are not assigned a valid home directory, there is no place for the storage and control of files they should own."
      solution    : "Configure RHEL 10 to assign home directories to all new local interactive users by setting the \"CREATE_HOME\" parameter in \"/etc/login.defs\" to \"yes\" as follows:

CREATE_HOME yes"
      reference   : "800-53|SI-16,800-53r5|SI-16,CAT|II,CCI|CCI-002824,CSF2.0|PR.DS-10,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),ITSG-33|SI-16,LEVEL|2A,Rule-ID|SV-281171r1166465_rule,STIG-ID|RHEL-10-600120,Vuln-ID|V-281171"
      see_also    : "https://workbench.cisecurity.org/benchmarks/26403"
      file        : "/etc/login.defs"
      regex       : "(?i)^[\\s]*CREATE_HOME[\\s]*"
      expect      : "(?i)^[\\s]*CREATE_HOME[\\s]*@CREATE_HOME@[\\s]*$"
    </custom_item>

    <item>
      description : "1.241 RHEL-10-600130"
      info        : "RHEL 10 must not allow duplicate user IDs (UIDs) to exist for interactive users.

GROUP ID: V-281172RULE ID: SV-281172r1166468

To ensure accountability and prevent unauthenticated access, interactive users must be identified and authenticated to prevent potential misuse and compromise of the system.

Satisfies: SRG-OS-000104-GPOS-00051, SRG-OS-000121-GPOS-00062"
      solution    : "Configure RHEL 10 to not allow duplicate UIDs to exist for interactive users.

Edit the file \"/etc/passwd\", and provide each interactive user account that has a duplicate UID with a unique UID."
      reference   : "800-171|3.5.1,800-171r3|03.05.01a.,800-53|IA-2,800-53|IA-8,800-53r5|IA-2,800-53r5|IA-8,CAT|II,CCI|CCI-000764,CCI|CCI-000804,CN-L3|7.1.3.1(a),CN-L3|7.1.3.1(e),CN-L3|8.1.4.1(a),CN-L3|8.1.4.2(a),CN-L3|8.5.4.1(a),CSF|PR.AC-1,CSF2.0|PR.AA-01,CSF2.0|PR.AA-03,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),HIPAA|164.312(a)(2)(i),HIPAA|164.312(d),ISO-27001-2022|A.5.16,ITSG-33|IA-2,ITSG-33|IA-2a.,ITSG-33|IA-8,ITSG-33|IA-8a.,LEVEL|2A,NESA|T2.3.8,NESA|T4.3.1,NESA|T5.3.1,NESA|T5.4.2,NESA|T5.5.1,NESA|T5.5.2,NESA|T5.5.3,NIAv2|AM2,NIAv2|AM8,NIAv2|AM14b,QCSC-v1|5.2.2,QCSC-v1|13.2,Rule-ID|SV-281172r1166468_rule,STIG-ID|RHEL-10-600130,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.8,TBA-FIISB|35.1,TBA-FIISB|36.1,Vuln-ID|V-281172"
