    <custom_item>
      type        : FILE_CONTENT_CHECK_NOT
      description : "1.276 RHEL-10-600520"
      info        : "RHEL 10 must restrict privilege elevation to authorized personnel.

GROUP ID: V-281207RULE ID: SV-281207r1166573

If the \"sudoers\" file is not configured correctly, any user defined on the system can initiate privileged actions on the target system."
      solution    : "Configure RHEL 10 to restrict privilege elevation to authorized personnel.

Remove the following entries from the \"/etc/sudoers\" file or configuration file under \"/etc/sudoers.d/\":

ALL ALL=(ALL) ALLALL ALL=(ALL:ALL) ALL"
