    <custom_item>
      type        : FILE_CHECK
      description : "1.88 RHEL-10-400005"
      info        : "RHEL 10 must be configured so that the \"/etc/group\" file is group-owned by \"root\".

GROUP ID: V-281018
RULE ID: SV-281018r1165409

The \"/etc/group\" file contains information regarding groups that are configured on the system. Protection of this file is important for system security."
